  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fskeeder461\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1512050/description_256b6a72-f787-4081-b8ee-ecac2633c280.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"428\" height=\"122\"></a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">关于 FOOTAGE：<br></span></strong></h1>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#117077\">FOOTAGE</span> 是一款适用于<span style=\"color:#21a112\">《我的世界》</span> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Java</span> <span style=\"color:#3598db\">光影包</span>，兼容版本<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">1.20</span> 至 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">1.21.11</span>，提供<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">海量</span>高质量的执法记录仪与 VHS 效果，以及超写实的光照、雾气和阴影，同时依然保持<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">极佳的优化性能</span></span></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1512050/description_6788aa8e-4d3d-4017-b3e2-0b3353328cd9.png\"></span></strong></p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><br><br></span></strong></h3>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><br><span style=\"color:#17a2ae\">FOOTAGE 的部分功能特性：</span></span></strong></h1>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">超写实光照/全局光照</span><br>-<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">体积光<br><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-<span style=\"color:#236fa1\">体积雾</span><br>-<span style=\"color:#21a112\">光影草模拟&nbsp;</span></span><br>-<span style=\"color:#169179\">海量执法记录仪效果</span><br>-<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">海量 VHS 效果<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\">水面模拟</span><br>-<span style=\"color:#34495e\">光影鸟类</span><br>-<span style=\"color:#17a2ae\">体积雾<br>-<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">体积云<br>-<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">完整表面渲染（支持资源包）<br>-<span style=\"color:#1fd80a\">光线追踪反射<br>-<span style=\"color:#21a112\">DLSS<br>-<span style=\"color:#bc8444\">镜头污渍<br>-<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">海量其他后处理效果（景深、色差等）<br>-超精细手电筒<br>-<span style=\"color:#17a2ae\">还有更多更多-<br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">IPBR<br></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1512050/description_cb5ae82d-5b64-4163-951b-925ad6c0cdfe.png\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1512050/description_8b4f98da-91dd-4628-b861-e899980c009f.png\"></span></strong><br><br><br><br></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#17a2ae\"><strong>我的电脑能运行这个光影吗？<br></strong></span></h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>~12 渲染距离下的帧率</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">RTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#fb1c03\">4090</span>&nbsp;</strong><strong>12GB - - - - - - - - -&nbsp;&nbsp;230 FPS<br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">RTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#21a112\">3090</span>&nbsp;8GB - - - - - - - - - -&nbsp;&nbsp;210&nbsp;FPS<br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">RTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">4070</span>&nbsp;8GB <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">笔记本</span> - - - - -&nbsp;210&nbsp;FPS<br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">RTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">2060</span>&nbsp;8GB - - - - - - - - - - -150&nbsp;FPS<br><span style=\"color:#21a112\">GTX </span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">1650</span> 4GB<span style=\"color:#236fa1\">笔记本</span> - - - - - 130 FPS &lt;我不确定为什么笔记本帧数更高<br><span style=\"color:#21a112\">GTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">1650ti</span>&nbsp;4GB- - - - -&nbsp;- - - - -110 FPS<br><span style=\"color:#21a112\">GTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">650ti</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">boost</span> 1GB - - - - -&nbsp;&nbsp;50&nbsp;FPS<br><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">8800</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#1fd80a\">GT</span>&nbsp;512MB&nbsp;- - - - - - - - -&nbsp;&nbsp;10 FPS &lt;令人难以置信的强大 2007 年显卡<br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">加入我们的 Discord</span>: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/dfTK72W3Y5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FOOTAGE DISCORD</a></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#21a112\">支持我</span><span style=\"color:#21a112\">？</span>: <a href=\"buymeacoffee.com/skeeder461\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">请我喝杯咖啡</a></strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h3>",
